# Anchors for ppc64. scripts/gen-mirrorlist writes the
# Server lines first and the Fallback line last, each in this order. It never
# ranks or drops them. At least one must answer.
#
# The Fallback is the GHCR mirror (pkgforge-dev/mirror-archlinux). It can be
# hours behind upstream, so a consumer reads it only when every other server
# fails. The build stage reads it first (use-transport).
#
# The first Server is the ArchPOWER origin. The second is a read-through proxy
# of the origin.
# ArchPOWER has no other mirror, so this port has no pool file.
# ⚠ The origin and the proxy answer HTTP 403 to GitHub runner addresses.
Server = https://repo.archlinuxpower.org/$repo/$arch
Server = https://api.rv.pkgforge.dev/https://repo.archlinuxpower.org/$repo/$arch
Fallback = https://ghcr.mirror.archlinux.pkgforge.dev/$arch/$repo
